@Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5108

### Get all games
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/games
Accept: application/json

### Get game by id
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/games/2
Accept: application/json

### Create a game
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "footballFieldId": 2,
  "createdByUserId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z",
  "maxPlayers": 10
}

### Delete a game
DELETE {{Backend_HostAddress}}/games/1